hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1311","Al-Fadl bin Yaqoub Al-Jazari told us, Abdul-Ala told us, on the authority of Muhammad, meaning Ibn Ishaq, Abdullah bin Muhammad told me, and he is my father’s son. Atiq, on the authority of Amer bin Saad, on the authority of his father Saad bin Abi Waqqas, who said: I heard the Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, saying: “If “If one of you snores in the mosque, let him conceal his phlegm, lest it strike the skin or clothing of a believer and harm him.”"
